---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Large Format Print" active="large-format-print">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Large Print</span>

        <h1>Big Ideas. Bigger <span>Impact</span></h1>

        <p>
          High-quality large format printing designed to get your brand noticed.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/contact" class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img
          src={asset('assets/images/9.large-print/hero.png')}
          alt="Professional promotional banner stands"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <div class="page-content">
    <section>
      <h2>Large Format Print</h2>
      <p>We offer the best in digital printing, taking pride in our <em>fast</em> and <em>efficient</em> service.</p>
      <p>We offer a wide range of products including large format digital printing, re-skinning modular displays, internal and outdoor banners, mesh, vinyls, flags, and placards.</p>
      <p><strong>Speak to us about your graphic requirements.</strong></p>
      <p>If you already own a display, we can supply new graphic panels to fit &mdash; whether or not originally supplied by us. We also offer shell scheme walling and can print directly onto foamex, correx, or dibond materials.</p>
      <p>For reception areas, internal decor, and signage, we print vinyl onto glass, and vinyl or inkjet onto acrylic, with stand-off fixings available.</p>
      <p><strong>If it's not in stock &ndash; we'll source it for you.</strong></p>
      <p>Call now &ndash; ask for Trevor<br>
      Email now &ndash; <a href="mailto:trevor@efexacademy.com">trevor@efexacademy.com</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-12">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/9.large-print/image1.jpg" alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference')} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
